      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DIOGO KEEPING (6) boasts a strong record this course with 13 wins and three minors from 17 tries. Hit the frame latest (19.64) when third at this track in a OPEN. Has the ability and should feature. FLYING HUGO (3) is a quick dog who thrives over the short dashes. Last start placegetter over 305m at Mt Gambier in a Grade 2/3/4 (17.82). Form at the trip excellent including 12 wins. Will give a great sight again. STIFLER (4) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (19.73) at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Can measure up this time. MINNIE'S MY MUM (7) will have admirers after placing last time out.",
